Package: earshot
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: curl
Suggests: nvidia-cuda-toolkit
Description: local speech-to-text with whisper.cpp
 earshot transcribes audio locally using whisper.cpp. It provides a C and C++
 library, a command line interface, SRT/WebVTT/JSON output and optional CUDA
 acceleration. Model weights are downloaded separately by the command line tool.
